5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know how the money works so nobody gets stuck with extra costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I need to see the total cost before we agree to anything, to avoid surprises.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I am curious about how the space affects our time together versus alone.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am worried about how much time we lose just getting to the place.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I need to know about the bathroom and where I can sit without being on a bed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, if we look at the rates, will that show who pays what?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,It should help. I want to see if the bill is one lump sum or separate.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,I think looking at the room arrangements might explain the crowding I felt.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,The travel time is the main issue for me. I want to check the schedules.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I agree with @Midori. The layout matters a lot for my sleep.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will look into the pricing of the houses and the last year's room costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the all-in rates and the pricing of the offshore houses.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will look at the time alone in the shared house and the room arrangements.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the ferry sailings and the train time to see the travel load.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the bathing hours and the inn mealtimes to plan my day.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Okay, let's see what we find. I hope it is clear.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will keep my notes ready for the next round.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I am looking forward to understanding the balance better.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will calculate the effective days available for us.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I just want a place where I can wash and rest easily.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
