35,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"I found that renting a house whole is about 5,400 yen a head a night.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"I saw that all-in rates charge the same for everyone, which feels unfair.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I learned that in the shared house year, there was nowhere to be alone.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The ferry takes two days total, but the train to the spa is only ninety minutes.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I found that the island houses have one bathroom for everyone and cold water.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, does the all-in rate mean we don't have to split meals?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, but it means I pay for your big appetite. I prefer separate bills.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,That explains why I felt crowded. We need a place with some separation.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,The train option saves us a full day compared to the ferry.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,One bathroom is too stressful for me. I need more privacy there.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"Last year, separate rooms cost nearly 8,000 yen more for some of us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,That is a big difference. A single bill for a house would be fairer.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"But the inn has fixed mealtimes. Dinner at six, breakfast at half seven.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The city has trains every few minutes, so we can move freely there.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"The inn baths open early, which is good, but the room is just futons.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"I think the city might be best for fairness, but the house is cheaper.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I am leaning towards the house if the total cost is clear and fixed.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I worry the house will feel too crowded again, like last time.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"The spa town seems efficient. Short travel, and we can move together.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am afraid of the shared bathroom on the island. The inn might be safer.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
