60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"So we have the Island, the City, and the Hot Spring Town.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"The Island has a fixed price per head, which I like for budgeting.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,"The Hot Spring Town has fixed meals, which might reduce our time together.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"The City allows us to split up, which might be good for those who need space.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,The Island has only one bathroom. That is a dealbreaker for me.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, that is a strong point. I don't want you to be miserable.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"I can accept the City if the costs are transparent, but it is expensive.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,"The Hot Spring Town has a public bath, so we don't have to share the room bath.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,The train to the spa is quick. We lose less time travelling than on the ferry.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,The public bath in the spa town sounds much better than the island house.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I think the Hot Spring Town balances cost and comfort well.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"I am still worried about the all-in meal cost, but the travel time is good.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,I prefer the Hot Spring Town. It feels like a proper holiday for us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I agree. The efficiency of the train and the bath access work for me.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will vote for the Hot Spring Town. The bathroom situation is better.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I am happy to go with the group. The Hot Spring Town seems right.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"I will accept the Hot Spring Town, provided we clarify the meal costs.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Midori,,I am glad we are choosing a place that allows for both togetherness and space.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,Let's lock it in. The logistics are the most manageable.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you. I feel much better about this choice.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
